0..77 Comment "//! Univalence at the corollas of a signature: `ua[1, 4](Magma, Magma, f, g)`"
78..153 Comment "//! is a path between the two models\' degree telescopes, derived corolla by"
154..204 Comment "//! corolla from the translator tables `f` and `g`"
205..274 Comment "//! [Shulman-2015-univalence_inverse_diagrams_homotopy_canonicity]. A"
275..354 Comment "//! univalence map acts as a typoid function [Petrakis-2022-univalent_typoids]."
355..432 Comment "//! Transport along it applies each corolla\'s translator, and two tables that"
433..479 Comment "//! agree at every element give the same path."
480..483 Comment "//!"
484..559 Comment "//! - cites: [Shulman-2015-univalence_inverse_diagrams_homotopy_canonicity]"
560..606 Comment "//! - cites: [Petrakis-2022-univalent_typoids]"
